#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:6
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:9
msgid "Installing Mixxx"
msgstr "安装 Mixxx"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:10
msgid ""
"After `downloading Mixxx from our Website <https://mixxx.org/download/>`_, "
"you need to install it on your computer."
msgstr "在`网站上下载 Mixxx <https://mixxx.org/download/>`_安装程序后，您需要进行安装。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:14 ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:48
msgid "**Windows**"
msgstr "Windows 系统"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:14
msgid ""
"Double-click the Mixxx installation file and go through the installation "
"wizard."
msgstr "双击 Mixxx 安装文件，并按照安装向导完成安装。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:18 ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:53
msgid "**macOS**"
msgstr "**macOS**"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:17
msgid ""
"Double-click the Mixxx .dmg file and drag the Mixxx icon to your "
"Applications folder."
msgstr "双击 Mixxx 的 .dmg 文件，然后将 Mixxx 图标拖动到“应用程序”文件夹中。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:22
msgid "**Linux**"
msgstr "**Linux**"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:21
msgid ""
"No steps are necessary after you followed the instructions on the download "
"page."
msgstr "按照下载页面中的说明操作后即可。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:25
msgid "Upgrading Mixxx"
msgstr "更新 Mixxx"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:30
msgid ""
"You may safely install Mixxx on top of any previous version. You don't need "
"to uninstall the old version."
msgstr "您可以放心地在现有版本之上直接安装 Mixxx，无需先卸载旧版本。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:33
msgid ""
"Your settings and library will not be removed or reset, but they may be "
"upgraded when you launch the new version of Mixxx. Note that we do not "
"guarantee that new configurations will work on older versions of Mixxx, "
"therefore you may want to make a backup of your existing settings just in "
"case."
msgstr ""
"您的设置和音乐库不会被删除或重置，但在启动新版 Mixxx 时可能会进行升级。请注意，我们无法保证新的配置能够在旧版本的 Mixxx "
"中正常使用，因此建议您备份现有设置，以防万一。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:38
msgid ""
"For locations in each supported :term:`OS <operating system>` as well as "
"detailed descriptions of the settings files, go to :ref:`appendix-settings-"
"files`."
msgstr ""
"有关各受支持:term:`操作系统 <operating system>`中的文件位置，以及设置文件的详细说明，请参阅 :ref:`appendix-"
"settings-files`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:41
msgid "Opening Mixxx"
msgstr "开启 Mixxx"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:42
msgid ""
"|logo| Once you've installed Mixxx, start by opening Mixxx and importing "
"your music to the Mixxx library."
msgstr "|logo| 安装好 Mixxx 后，首先打开 Mixxx，并将您的音乐导入 Mixxx 音乐库。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:46
msgid ""
"Double-click the Mixxx icon on the Desktop. Alternatively, browse your "
"Windows start menu and click the Mixxx icon, or perform a search for "
":file:`Mixxx.exe`."
msgstr ""
"双击桌面上的 Mixxx 图标。或者，打开 Windows 开始菜单并点击 Mixxx 图标，也可以搜索 :file:`Mixxx.exe`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:51
msgid ""
"Double-click the Mixxx icon in the :file:`Applications` folder. "
"Alternatively, drag the Mixxx icon to the dock and double-click it there or "
"search for :command:`mixxx` in Spotlight."
msgstr ""
"双击 :file:`应用程序` 文件夹中的 Mixxx 图标。或将 Mixxx 图标拖到程序坞中并双击启动，您也可以在聚焦(Spotlight) 中搜索"
" :command:`mixxx` 启动。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:62
msgid "**GNU/Linux**"
msgstr "**GNU/Linux**"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:56
msgid ""
"Click the Mixxx icon in the applications menu or launcher of your desktop "
"environment or perform a search for :file:`mixxx`. Alternatively type "
":command:`mixxx` into the terminal, then hit :kbd:`Return`. If your "
":term:`audio interface` is not accessible from Mixxx because it is used by "
"other applications via PulseAudio, you may close and restart Mixxx using "
":command:`pasuspender mixxx`. See :ref:`appendix-command-line-options` for "
"an overview of Mixxx's command line options."
msgstr ""
"点击桌面或应用程序菜单中的 Mixxx 图标，或经由搜索 \\:file:`mixxx`，亦或是在终端中输入 :command:`mixxx` 并按下 "
"\\:kbd:`Enter` 键启动。若因为其他应用程序通过 PulseAudio 占用了:term:`音频接口`，您可关闭 Mixxx 后使用 "
"\\:command:`pasuspender mixxx` 命令重新启动。有关 Mixxx 命令行选项的详细信息，请参阅 "
"\\:ref:`appendix-command-line-options`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:67
msgid "Importing your audio files"
msgstr "添加你的音频文件"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:79
msgid "Mixxx 1st run - Choose music library directory dialog"
msgstr "Mixxx 首次运行 - 选择曲库目录对话框"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:79
msgid "Mixxx running on Windows 10 - Choose music library directory dialog"
msgstr "在 Windows 10 上运行的 Mixxx - 选择曲库目录对话框"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:81
msgid ""
"The first time you run Mixxx, you are asked to select a directory where your"
" music is stored. By default, the dialog points to a location where music "
"files are typically held, but you can select any location on your computer."
msgstr "初次运行 Mixxx 时，系统会提示您选择存放音乐的目录。默认情况下，对话框会定位到通常存放音乐文件的位置，但您也可以选择其他目录。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:85
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Select Folder` and Mixxx will scan your music library. "
"Depending on the size of your library this could take some time. All the "
"supported music files Mixxx detects will be listed in the :ref:`library-"
"tracks`."
msgstr ""
"点击:guilabel:`选择文件夹`按钮后，Mixxx 将开始扫描你的音乐库。扫描所需时间取决于您曲库的大小。扫描完成后，Mixxx "
"检测到的所支持的音乐文件都会显示在 \\:ref:`library-tracks` 中。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:89
msgid ""
"If you want to refresh your library (for example because you added or moved "
"files), you can do this with :menuselection:`Library --> Rescan Library` in "
"the menu. If you want to rescan at every launch, select "
":menuselection:`Preferences --> Library --> Rescan on startup`."
msgstr ""
"若添加或移动了音乐文件需要更新曲库，您可在菜单中选择\\:menuselection:`曲库 --> 重新扫描曲库`。如果希望 Mixxx "
"每次启动时自动重新扫描，您可在\\:menuselection:`设置 --> 曲库`中启用\\:guilabel:`启动时重新扫描`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:94
msgid ""
"On Windows 7 and 8 the import dialog points to your Windows “Music“ Library,"
" a special-purpose virtual folder. You can **not** use these virtual "
"folders. Select a regular folder instead, usually “My Music“, like pictured "
"above."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 7 和 Windows 8 中，导入对话框默认指向 Windows "
"的“音乐”库，这是一个特殊用途的虚拟文件夹，**无法**直接使用。请改为选择普通文件夹，通常为“我的音乐”，如上图所示。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:102
msgid "Analyze your library"
msgstr "分析曲库"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:108
msgid ""
"|ic_lib_analyze| Mixxx automatically analyzes tracks the first time you load"
" them in a deck. This allows you to run :term:`beatgrid`, :term:`key`, and "
":term:`ReplayGain` detection on tracks in advance. It also prepares the "
"waveform overviews, detects file corruption, and calculates the :term:`BPM` "
"values."
msgstr ""
"|ic_lib_analyze| 首次将曲目加载到播放器时，Mixxx 会自动进行分析，自动检测:term:`节拍网格`、:term:`调性`和 "
":term:`ReplayGain` ，同时生成波形概览、检查文件是否损坏，并计算 :term:`BPM`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:111
msgid "For more information, go to :ref:`configuration-bpm-detection`."
msgstr "有关详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`configuration-bpm-detection`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:114
msgid "Why you should analyze your audio files"
msgstr "为何要分析音频文件"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:116
msgid ""
"If the tracks have never been played with Mixxx before, the library columns "
":guilabel:`BPM`, :guilabel:`Duration` and :guilabel:`Key` will be empty or "
"unreliable (because the values are just read from the file's tags if present"
" and might be wrong). Pre-generating beatgrids gives you the chance to "
"double-check the beat markers to make sure they are correct. Errors in "
"beatgrids can cause difficulty when syncing tracks. Furthermore, track "
"analysis takes considerable CPU power and might cause skips in the audio ---"
" things you surely don't need while performing."
msgstr ""
"若曲目此前从未在 Mixxx 中播放过，曲库中的 \\:guilabel:`BPM`、\\:guilabel:`时长` 和 "
"\\:guilabel:`调性` "
"列将为空或不准确（因为这些值仅会从音频文件的标签中读取，而标签信息本身可能并不正确）。提前生成节拍网格后，您可以检查节拍标记是否准确，避免因节拍网格错误而影响对拍。另外，分析曲目会占用较多"
" CPU 资源。在演出过程中进行分析可能导致音频卡顿，这显然不是您希望发生的情况。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:124
msgid "How to analyze your audio files"
msgstr "如何分析音频文件"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:125
msgid ""
"Once you have :ref:`imported your music library<getting-started-import-"
"audio-files>`, press :guilabel:`OK` on the Preferences window."
msgstr ""
"完成\\:ref:`导入音乐文件<getting-started-import-audio-"
"files>`后，在“设置”窗口中点击\\:guilabel:`确定`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:128
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Analyze` view on the left side panel of the library."
msgstr "在曲库左侧边栏中，切换到\\:guilabel:`分析`视图。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:129
msgid ""
"To analyze a few specific tracks, hold down the :kbd:`Ctrl` button, and "
"select the tracks that you want to analyze or you can :kbd:`shift`-select a "
"range of tracks. Once they've been highlighted, click the "
":guilabel:`Analyze` button on the top right of the library section."
msgstr ""
"若要分析指定曲目，请按住 :kbd:`Ctrl` 键选择需要分析的曲目，或按住 :kbd:`Shift` "
"键选择一些曲目。选中后，点击曲库区域右上角的\\:guilabel:`分析`按钮。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:130
msgid ""
"To analyze the newly added tracks, toggle the :guilabel:`New` label and then"
" click :guilabel:`Analyze`."
msgstr "若要分析新添加的曲目，请切换到\\:guilabel:`新曲目`标签，然后点击\\:guilabel:`分析`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:131
msgid ""
"To analyze the entire library, toggle the :guilabel:`All` label and then "
"click :guilabel:`Analyze`."
msgstr "若要分析整个曲库，请切换到\\:guilabel:`全部`标签，然后点击\\:guilabel:`分析`。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:132
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`New` and :guilabel:`All` toggle buttons are located at the "
"top left of the analysis pane - just above the :guilabel:`Preview` and "
":guilabel:`Cover Art` column titles of the library."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`新曲目`和:guilabel:`全部`切换按钮位于分析面板左上角，即曲库中:guilabel:`试听`和\\:guilabel:`封面`列标题的上方。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:134
msgid ""
"While analyzing, the progress in percentage and total queue length are "
"shown."
msgstr "分析过程中会显示当前进度百分比和歌曲队列总长度。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:139
msgid "Configuring sound input and output"
msgstr "配置声音输入和输出"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:141
msgid ""
"Before you can start using Mixxx, you need to configure Mixxx to use your "
"sound hardware in :menuselection:`Preferences --> Sound Hardware`. You do "
"not need to configure all inputs and outputs."
msgstr ""
"在开始使用 Mixxx 之前，您需要在 :menuselection:`设置 --> 声音硬件` 中配置 Mixxx "
"使用的声音硬件。您无需配置所有输入和输出项。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:145
msgid ""
"The :ref:`hardware` chapter explains different types of DJ hardware and how "
"to set them up with the input and output options. For Mixxx to perform the "
"best it can on your system, configure the other :ref:`preferences-sound-"
"hardware` preferences in addition to the inputs and outputs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`hardware` 一章李介绍了不同类型的 DJ 硬件，以及如何设置不同的输入和输出选项。为了让 Mixxx "
"在您的系统上发挥最佳性能，除了配置输入和输出外，还建议配置其他 :ref:`preferences-sound-hardware` 设置。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:157
msgid "Mixxx Sound Hardware Preferences"
msgstr "Mixxx 声音设备设置"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:160
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "输出选项"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:162
#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:182
msgid "**Internal mixing**:"
msgstr "**内部混音**："

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:164
msgid ""
"Use these outputs if you are not using an :ref:`external hardware mixer "
"<hardware-mixers>`. If you are using a controller with a built-in audio "
"interface, use these outputs."
msgstr ""
"如果您没有:ref:`外置混音器 <hardware-mixers>`，则无须使用这些输出。如果您使用的是带内置音频接口的控制器，则请使用这些输出。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:168
msgid ""
"*Main*: all decks, samplers, microphones, and auxiliary inputs mixed "
"together. This output is sent to the speakers for the audience."
msgstr "*主输出*：混合所有唱盘、采样器、麦克风和辅助输入的声音。此输出会发送到听众使用的扬声器。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:170
msgid ""
"*Headphones*: all decks, samplers, microphones, and auxiliary inputs "
"assigned to :term:`pre-fader listening <PFL>`"
msgstr "*耳机*：分配到:term:`推子前监听 <PFL>`的所有唱盘、采样器、麦克风和辅助输入。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:172
msgid "*Booth*: same as main output, but has a separate gain control"
msgstr "*监听输出*：与主输出相同，但具有独立的增益控制。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:174
#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:190
msgid "**External mixing**:"
msgstr "**外部混音**："

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:176
msgid "*Decks 1-4*: the individual unmixed decks to send to an external mixer"
msgstr "*唱盘 1-4*：发送到外置混音器的各个未混音唱盘输出。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:177
msgid ""
"*Bus Left/Center/Right*: all decks, samplers, and auxiliary inputs assigned "
"to each side of Mixxx's :term:`crossfader`"
msgstr "*左/中/右总线*：分配到 Mixxx :term:`交叉渐变器 <crossfader>`侧边的所有唱盘、采样器和辅助输入。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:181
msgid "Input Options"
msgstr "输入选项"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:184
msgid ""
"Use these inputs if you are not using an external hardware mixer. If you are"
" using a controller with a built-in audio interface, use these inputs."
msgstr "如果您未没有外置混音器硬件或使用的是带内置音频接口的控制器，则请使用这些输入。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:187
msgid "*Microphone 1-4*: live microphone or musical instrument inputs"
msgstr "*麦克风 1-4*：实时麦克风或乐器输入。"

#: ../../chapters/getting_started.rst:188
msgid "*Auxiliary 1-4*: other sound sources"
